{"pull": {"id": "number:20792", "number": 20792, "title": "KAFKA-19394: Failure in ConsumerNetworkThread.initializeResources() can cause hangs on AsyncKafkaConsumer.close()", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2025-10-30T00:08:36Z", "closed_at": "2025-11-18T11:17:20Z", "merged_at": "2025-11-18T11:17:20Z", "user": {"login": "kirktrue", "id": 92057, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjkyMDU3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92057?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue", "html_url": "https://github.com/kirktrue", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "`ApplicationEventHandler` now waits for the `ConsumerNetworkThread` to\nstart up and complete execution of `initializeResources()`. If resource\ninitialization fails, the `AsyncKafkaConsumer` constructor will throw an\nexception. This mimics the behavior of `ClassicKafkaConsumer`.\n\nReviewers: Andrew Schofield <aschofield@confluent.io>, Liam\n Clarke-Hutchinson <liam@steelsky.co.nz>\n", "labels": [{"id": 851033232, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4NTEwMzMyMzI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/consumer", "name": "consumer", "color": "bf6a03", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7491388177, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABvoW